{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "1TI",
  "chapter": 2,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I exhort therefore, that, first of all, supplications, prayers, intercessions, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " giving of thanks, be made for all men;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For kings, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all that are in authority; that we may lead a quiet and peaceable life in all godliness and honesty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good and acceptable in the sight of God our Saviour;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who will have all men to be saved, and to come unto the knowledge of the truth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one God, and one mediator between God and men, the man Christ Jesus;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who gave himself a ransom for all, to be testified in due time.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where unto I am ordained a preacher, and an apostle, (I speak the truth in Christ, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lie not;) a teacher of the Gentiles in faith and verity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will therefore that men pray every where, lifting up holy hands, without wrath and doubting.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In like manner also, that women adorn themselves in modest apparel, with shamefacedness and sobriety; not with broided hair, or gold, or pearls, or costly array;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But (which becometh women professing godliness) with good works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let the woman learn in silence with all subjection.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I suffer not a woman to teach, nor to usurp authority over the man, but to be in silence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Adam was first formed, then Eve.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Adam was not deceived, but the woman being deceived was in the transgression.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TI.2.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:1TI.2.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Notwithstanding she shall be saved in childbearing, if they continue in faith and charity and holiness with sobriety.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
